\item[* task:] To create a corresponding DO-clitic when the DO is a PERSPRO;
the PERSPRO is deleted. This rule is for cases where the DO-clitic would 
precede the indirect object clitic, which is deleted here, to meet the
order preasumed IO-DO; the IO-PERSPRO constituent will not be deleted
in later rules.\\   
WARNING: this rule is not reversible; analytically the NP-node is not
recovered!
